hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15513","Abd al-Samad and Affan both said: Thabit narrated to us, Affan said: Ibn Zayd, Abu Zayd, Hilal ibn Khabbab narrated to us, from Ikrimah ibn Khalid, he said: An Arif of the Arifs of Quraysh narrated to me, my father narrated to me that he heard, from the mouth, concerning the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him): Whoever fasts Ramadan and Shawwal and Wednesday and Thursday and Friday shall enter Paradise."
